      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think i can do this much longer. the hunger... it's not even like pain anymore, it just feels like i'm disappearing. and then the soldiers will come and find us like this, just... hollowed out and broken. i don't want them to see me like this. i don't want anyone to see me like this.",
