      "content": "The thought of controlling the end is a desperate attempt to reclaim some power when everything else feels out of your grasp. It's a heavy burden, but you deserve to feel peace, not just in the end, but right now. If you are truly feeling that the only control left is over your final moments, please know that there are people who want to help you find a different kind of peace first. Call a helpline; they can offer immediate, confidential support.",
